    {
      "id": "17e65d9620be5eb345043d1b399903b5e04ea42ba31c7379eeec280f986951b9",
      "text": "Anthropic thinks you should build agents like this",
      "hash": "dce9e27d2f9993b886f1f073a677ae4b6e91bb493d827c0cacbd9ad4162c37de"
    },
    {
      "id": "63007390077b1e0845904185ebf907aecb089f302eb4743c68442ae6a45e0e4c",
      "text": "Learn how agents differ from workflows and why to start AI projects with LLM APIs, not frameworks.",
      "hash": "998993b3746d6f641679d00a6d3581773ccd7686cc6dfdf69de95bd74d85a61a"
    },
    {
      "id": "77fb56eea400bee66292ae5804c9b18d09c71e68ff71c712d58b64798fdabe32",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "9ea27565f1ff820dd1c3102e34702f782a4693f2280b94ff4a31239f5094a620",
      "text": "Subscribe",
      "hash": "cc0e38da9c41790bffef1b88af32d39ac285edce93da766810edc237cb2f1625"
    },
    {
      "id": "4a7c1212464568e8555f21c4c30c8ab6aa6a366347d910acc8097a6ed30ad576",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "d22593a69bc210956db32e193b7882870e83d30f5c38af335035bd2d52777a04",
      "text": "Share",
      "hash": "29887a5ff9846ccc23327565a07e17fa6dcaea6211f1898ae825f84ae38f4223"
    },
    {
      "id": "55dc8e482e69cac29cb48ca0c83b1546186b8b2562e7cfab3b416606ae57731f",
      "text": "On this page",
      "hash": "b5658fc8edda24f9c94eabac9e536e0a18e3055a8ca255f9d1b8f256ea02a6cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "70a214a1820eb4173a2652e22c8f1fdba070069646d913a0182a0012157e6296",
      "text": "Agents vs Workflows",
      "hash": "f57b0de226b89b7495b2e5033cc5a800fa8b5a31994dca6835a94d5170851cbd"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0aad40af5d69e85de235726c000851f589dbb30299b843370aa95dd96ae0205",
      "text": "Don't Use Frameworks By Default",
      "hash": "f5e7477391b67e2480c8031f5ecb0df6f907af32278957f5d75ec6b620b4c241"
    },
    {
      "id": "3a91e27f546dc581fc197d95a9300c8551f0b43f1c6f5f909b37b8c1169141c2",
      "text": "Many Workflow Patterns, One Agentic Pattern",
      "hash": "9870d7de526bf1005d2e7663b435247dca71089e320f36c2ebaf57e4b6da297a"
    },
    {
      "id": "a322f40bf3c3b603e0cb6b7b426f79373e28a29a3c02391da5a9260eecc54879",
      "text": "Related reading",
      "hash": "89c21c36ad5ffbab7b05ced367c46013c8d7b8ddf53a8b9739b7b2545f78abee"
    },
    {
      "id": "8cf9b45fecae4d2aeaf2d237cc50da1ae960ba5e34a005c324a2c8c0e24494d5",
      "text": "In December 2024, Anthropic dropped an article on",
      "hash": "a786864b4dd181e27cf5d106ca3395c385bc2d8652cdb0133935549956165908"
    },
    {
      "id": "518a288fa05b86e2fe135a58e31d250911a2a526054d4a68a1ec13f4b7df6cc2",
      "text": "Building Effective Agents",
      "hash": "50fda3723f4b5fa2e1b62e94101c293e0453faf0db09bbb7e96ea5619a0cfff4"
    },
    {
      "id": "1aca9d86fe8e70d1b4fff7a5043d184e3a12d2fb71c7218c420907145549af3f",
      "text": ". It really clarified a few concepts for me. Here's my summary:",
      "hash": "5a1491abea16ed223c29534b638de2634620c6490dc0c03c57adc8be69cf9557"
    },
    {
      "id": "de983ed9f42e63d6231234fb228faa7eeb6b3ad1d2e726c81a068c03e153731b",
      "text": "It defines",
      "hash": "160a9089b1e679d99f00549e62ebf65d47bc76eb6c100650fa84815efd6ae3a8"
    },
    {
      "id": "f13fe16296e0b8e7f615cf13d556d411711beffa7f7b1f2695d2f1a868170c1b",
      "text": "Agents",
      "hash": "279b44d2ab4b40c0fc132f8f3051293544cca91de9c8aa14f2cd29adb132b0ee"
    },
    {
      "id": "49c7d55ce5d53592d75e31359baeadf503b485ea540f9045dd7e62f025ec4e58",
      "text": "as different from",
      "hash": "4095d64e20113b963f657ff2cd06e29694133355ed1ed283b0c6aaea433455b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "bbc30cec670ba4552247ff54fb174e4c48a6508b96fcc41e0fee99e943f42d99",
      "text": "Workflows",
      "hash": "e2073645cb0dbbddb2464dacc4ed2a03923b8e4a4b680245c36c69763766fb40"
    },
    {
      "id": "5951d24bb15a146217653a442a75e9d70dcff9af5aca186bc2a062d88f7f1b8a",
      "text": "Workflows use \"predefined code paths\", whereas agents \"dynamically direct their own processes\". The difference between them, then, is the degree of autonomy. Agents have more autonomy, workflows run on pre-defined rails.",
      "hash": "092fce13cab1cfdc32f38c4a90166d061ad84ee1a56954ef9a8e3ea0b851e2f0"
    },
    {
      "id": "f9847e84301a8a2fd0d826d1820005a4175c352e240b0719afa302a75fb64481",
      "text": "This still feels to me like a gradient - but having the scale be \"degree of autonomy\" is something I've not seen much before.",
      "hash": "34e8f7f41538d98e82d89e1e0cf3095e008cc9b3e3e74b2c111edfe4ad2d0827"
    },
    {
      "id": "9550ba200e3cebf273155decf4815aeb8755b72ad59770384abe915ad64861ae",
      "text": "Go deeper:",
      "hash": "15ad3d88c6733d9b257c322d3afecc9bce2b18558171007db87598c118ca17f9"
    },
    {
      "id": "7d216e1751a99d1cddea504de07f783b7aec3898baa9e04e8ce5679665a9711f",
      "text": "join the waitlist for AI Coding for Real Engineers",
      "hash": "16c3492a8464a0859c944e287a9d433e9a2635f22a6bd8aad59f88c3e80ab732"
    },
    {
      "id": "97580c1b7f41b5419875828353b01e253b87102d9f01760c40f59aac8933b7e8",
      "text": "The article repeatedly warns against using frameworks as a first port of call. They \"often create extra layers of abstraction that can obscure the underling prompts and responses\".",
      "hash": "d38fb3e1d9540db4942c46e80ca441579a112c9ef826d78821299795887139a9"
    },
    {
      "id": "bc564c35aca97c779b122126abacecebcc12e2d41e5fba26e2efedd4c1dcfa92",
      "text": "They mention",
      "hash": "e4de850076fafd8e3b7319e24d9eb0779671f2cad8d2b5f8539da23f045777dd"
    },
    {
      "id": "cdc39eec6f20ed2e5764dfbc017bec241d44da58041df737f4de865aff79b447",
      "text": "LangGraph",
      "hash": "845bbc27a312cec74a653a429222ceebf75ccce4e6f551ed536aafa2eeef5aa3"
    },
    {
      "id": "07ff79711cea4ec5d453d6cbf271dd04b6fde653068f0a7feb24eb88f883cc1a",
      "text": "Amazon Bedrock Agents",
      "hash": "37320e6cf287a4480e559e1258bf20c8ecc1325c1d7f497f2b0e5253afbe7e50"
    },
    {
      "id": "79cc0f85add9ca2d38bfca6adb6affa00442fea39f243c56670e1aad15db39b4",
      "text": "Rivet",
      "hash": "e3c96cfb53c6ed3e03eb5ccd1efc1531924e07458a31eb3ba5ecaea5e9787b54"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2a5230a03f6ae1daf3e1629752a900ba18deafaa7fd525d472b536337163a5f",
      "text": "Vellum",
      "hash": "53db2e1eaa5780fcae55e8c5d17d9b2ca9ab413b66857c7e116823173a05f79f"
    },
    {
      "id": "205bfae9e925a1b305c307a4536f5058c7c5d2ff3ee34d166d81a53491d80111",
      "text": ". These frameworks \"make it tempting to add complexity when a simpler setup would suffice\".",
      "hash": "23e63b5d42529e44ebcf396ab6f14a2f6c86fb9972f86383781cf1982a4aca80"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3925ae4803d6ad6dd68575546c0baeecbfe5293ecbb0986818bfaec8c28ab7c",
      "text": "Instead, using LLM API's directly is what they recommend to start with. You should only use a framework when \"you understand the underlying code\".",
      "hash": "b468d1e5751ee48c4c36ea5fffc2fbe23c1fca86ae28895bdceb98a86f661b36"
    },
    {
      "id": "9acb570ba04e711b237f2cdcebe68ffa6967d0a8f02e6a46c1769583e9c63edc",
      "text": "This sounds right to me - the primitives of building good AI workflows don't sound that difficult to manage. Putting them in a framework prematurely feels odd. Note that I don't consider something like Vercel's",
      "hash": "e7b406ead1fb7c3740bb39c52c04098d45877f4e8898a024cb932650a4bfb5d8"
    },
    {
      "id": "cbb4cd18b5338db4ff94333bbb29e2c7f5ccfb22da694027864d3c3e482e2b13",
      "text": "AI SDK",
      "hash": "28be6635dba26975426f7abe9faee90ffec8618b6973180321ecfb664117fb4a"
    },
    {
      "id": "a33f70b3fddd1b14a74c08e98dc0c713b15ab3caa29ed173dad361eeb191c1e1",
      "text": "a framework - it's just a compatibility library.",
      "hash": "2390a6eed7a570962a0217c8e361d2d90a1be6b30425cfbabb8f05f087b2090f"
    },
    {
      "id": "65b8f2952c8e6468933d3065dd393461b64f067407532b21f8352a9a15290e2c",
      "text": "The most wonderful part of this article is how it describes different workflows. Far from building effective agents, this article really describes how to build effective workflows. It describes:",
      "hash": "7eb5dc1f51dea1878b71be3716a5394ef4a8dca9a6a27faf27781d3ab55b76f5"
    },
    {
      "id": "2eedb17fa32c56356fe5a63b2b33015f346c610ab1a0ecfa576577b21df2eaed",
      "text": "Prompt chaining, where \"each LLM call processes the output of the previous one\"",
      "hash": "a162658e7a871cefa96cd531b9896424018d25dafafa570640e819b8e1635874"
    },
    {
      "id": "9787980636428f6b932ec3f76f787b69a69ef481ae492163bed96d0523a30687",
      "text": "Routing, where an LLM router \"classifies an input and directs it to a specialized followup task\"",
      "hash": "adab87a80c54992634bc2d6e8d6b36878272e4f4dacbed3f1cdc9322d4eae8e6"
    },
    {
      "id": "48cae8294b0533035ae838ee17f106fe9d5be022ec31e7734e377686b274ae52",
      "text": "Parallelization, where LLM calls are run in parallel.",
      "hash": "4964cf5d8cb1deb091a629991e72d81819eb0db386a41de10b371e29ed9c1fe9"
    },
    {
      "id": "c72063edcd903bdaf43235adce0f441850544d73c1669cb09ca7b0ac5382cc2b",
      "text": "Orchestrator-workers, where a \"central LLM dynamically breaks down tasks\" and \"delegates them to worker LLM's\".",
      "hash": "7820ba845fc19a5601f3734665871128db921b322635c6928f2dedbe2c05655e"
    },
    {
      "id": "ff779423464e3763e2572c6695925d1ab83fc73827e35930310b326e8a41a3f6",
      "text": "Evaluator-optimizer, where \"one LLM call generates a response while another provides evaluation\" in a loop.",
      "hash": "ef0fccc7b42b04ab6ff5b9d517c5d5893ded744f7726a903ff38859ee7655024"
    },
    {
      "id": "cee08e470f498ab1ac0c0af1a3c80dc98888d4a5831e25385b19b377100d5d21",
      "text": "Finally, it defines a single pattern it would define as agentic. Agents:",
      "hash": "b108423787ae03c6abe9876e23bfda17c89535287edf78d667ed35001c036167"
    },
    {
      "id": "da7cf2e191a1386169bb7806813176593c28a31ecbbcf2d52ae91356a72fb6ef",
      "text": "\"Plan and operate independently, potentially returning to the human for further information or judgement\"",
      "hash": "78f58a1657b18c41726503365c2966cb55b8ae676c7b1296f9ea24317297e325"
    },
    {
      "id": "58b0eaf00d15d6262a693a0001a4bb3738b2f5e43683d73b695ae15bcfff839b",
      "text": "\"Gain ground truth from the environment at each step\", using",
      "hash": "622369588531ce831e20f0928d7cceca9fd8ec737307367319dd10fc8ac18bb5"
    },
    {
      "id": "b237aa6ff59f68ec749a0709eb78f505609b4fcf407b36650b69f26a0154840b",
      "text": "tool call",
      "hash": "56e7059d39717d558a3cd6526f07f33310ec6c83132c1f7692a9fc3a37684573"
    },
    {
      "id": "305924074beb3ff6b5ce7a8063be6537965e763c32025be3c3e4ff2063403eea",
      "text": "results or code execution",
      "hash": "315ad2f922296f14fda7ff68d370c97250c49c5a3f49fce85fdaeffa3a4a5c15"
    },
    {
      "id": "9fcff75f3ab6a00a57b9b35250e61d27355f45ffff418a6d9716bc8ed7759507",
      "text": "Terminate upon completion, or using a \"stopping condition (such as a maximum number of iterations)\"",
      "hash": "d55682a4e79ef07f0ca9f06f4f47f282fa4a6aad33a890fd3206a606fd815251"
    },
    {
      "id": "3f3c72b4e8a9712cdeba0fcae232fc317300e501dbcfa433242d95ae8acdf5dd",
      "text": "In summary, agents are \"typically just LLMs using tools based on environmental feedback in a loop\".",
      "hash": "b4d49e552924392e9423952469677dd33d50c2f793b531d46cc4dd8a535ae83f"
    },
    {
      "id": "5f7288f302694ec873a5096800d0f6ca62b8b4c82a36d4b39a04bb02e80ac89f",
      "text": "I really dig this definition - it demystifies agents nicely.",
      "hash": "c5928f8af5a3f3d35537d3e88d0c0a1677301ff29883a8549769aae4a41f515f"
    },
    {
      "id": "7d5bb1a4a87c2f10b5189c9cff74262a0f5a507648834969f37183ba881b2668",
      "text": "Share on X",
      "hash": "78d21bbf6b047944ec42890d28e151c61dbab35213fc65cc7be70c0c19c24407"
    },
    {
      "id": "b611420f32112530dbfadb7f3fae2bbacda7254a6e38f92ce01a211b228c0d54",
      "text": "Share on Bluesky",
      "hash": "08863b88a05c60410c38c4caec5bc72535b0f01793ce6cee9171b6358b2c11da"
    },
    {
      "id": "7461b042f2a092e572f9c9981126a5ed34380adf26fc6faa5b89e1df3ffc1b0c",
      "text": "Share on LinkedIn",
      "hash": "ab87c050148bd1d372e3ec3483a606127a7a1faec0f1ca5543bc3465d84fe6c9"
    },
    {
      "id": "cfcd82c6865e3eebdf6529b98203d4202b46e26d65c899b8f9c709294d12c495",
      "text": "Copy URL",
      "hash": "b26d1037f1c2da31a0296d915982f12049f91bfedb998b105ce967b73a796699"
    },
    {
      "id": "b10fe13a98d4b244fbe1cddfceef962068e2a0de636334f4d412ecdd099d2fdc",
      "text": "List · 1 min read",
      "hash": "02e6a81c0d54e6b3344643bef8643fe11e1aa2a9324d7f74f42fd66e8014d952"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3e008c6c1d6819a35247bbb7611bdbcdc0b21f0b76d5124be9c6463a1d6b3a4",
      "text": "Article · 5 min read",
